{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object detected, move, take, check properties, perform task. Otherwise, scan environment.     list of available nodes: <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Action ID = MoveToObjPos    /> <SubTree ID = PickUpObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = PerformSpecificTask    /> <Action ID = ScanEnvironment    />",
